        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s team possesses superior political judgment and insight compared to others.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Electoral outcomes are determined more by strategic positioning than by individual candidates.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Being 'a little closer' than expected does not undermine the validity of prior predictions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s group has moral legitimacy and competence in shaping political outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Political success depends on narrative framing and issue salience rather than random factors.",
        "confidence": 0.87
