        "text": "I will remain consistently present during the campaign.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "I currently possess the ability to travel throughout the state of Alabama.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "I will become a more recognizable figure compared to prior statewide candidates.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Engaging in dialogue with people is key to success.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Previous statewide Democratic candidates lacked sufficient funding.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A stronger party infrastructure will exist within two years.",
