        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Increased turnout in the presidential race will benefit Democratic candidates.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "My consistent campaigning reflects genuine commitment rather than performative effort.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Ballot splitting among voters is likely due to increased engagement.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic gains are possible even in a predominantly Republican electorate.",
        "confidence": 0.86
