    "turn_text": "I would say the most controversial vote you've probably taken this year, the most heavily criticized vote, at least by your voters in Alabama, is the judicial vote around Brett Kavanaugh, Trump's Supreme Court Justice nominee. You mentioned that you voted for a lot of Trump's judges, but obviously you very publicly voted against the confirmation of Brett Kavanaugh. Why?",
